{"id": "t089-001", "text": "Thabo's daughter graduates from Leeds on June 3rd. He's flying her grandparents over from Durban for it. Remind me to send a card the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Leeds", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-002", "text": "Need to pick up the dry cleaning before Friday and drop the parcel at the post office. The counter shuts at five.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up the dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop the parcel at the post office", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "five", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t089-003", "text": "Dorota said her son Bogdan starts primary school next Tuesday. She's far more nervous about it than he is, apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "primary school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-004", "text": "Graham's mum is having her hip replaced on 5/14. Dr Banerjee is doing the operation. Graham is taking the whole week off to look after her and his dad, who can't really cope on his own anymore. I should call him the weekend after to see how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Banerjee", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't really cope on his own", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-005", "text": "Spoke to Eva after book club. Her brother Darius has just finished his medical finals and gets his results in a fortnight. She says he's barely sleeping.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical finals", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-006", "text": "Eamon and his wife celebrate their 25th anniversary on July 9th. They're having dinner at the place by the harbour. He hinted she'd love a framed print of their wedding venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner at the place by the harbour", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a framed print of their wedding venue", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t089-007", "text": "Remind me to ask Anders how Jonah's driving test went. It was this morning.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Anders how Jonah's driving test went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-008", "text": "Chiara's little girl lost her first tooth yesterday and is now trying to negotiate a better rate with the tooth fairy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-009", "text": "Elif is vegetarian and can't stand coriander. Worth remembering for the barbecue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand coriander", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t089-010", "text": "Tendai's graduation party has been called off because his grandad is in hospital. Don't forget to message him tomorrow to see how they're all doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-011", "text": "Akira mentioned her husband Rhys is retiring at the end of the month after thirty years at the council. Must get him a card and maybe a bottle of something nice.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thirty years at the council", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a card and maybe a bottle of something nice", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t089-012", "text": "Book the car in for its MOT. It runs out on October 28th.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book the car in for its MOT", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 28th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-013", "text": "Dana's twins start nursery on Monday, and she's going back to work part time the same week, so it's going to be chaos in their house. Her mother-in-law is meant to be helping with pickups but has just broken her wrist. Text Dana on Monday evening to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken her wrist", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Dana", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-014", "text": "Mia rang. Her dog Biscuit had an operation on his back leg on Saturday. He's home now but on crate rest for six weeks, which he hates.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}]}
{"id": "t089-015", "text": "Tobi passed his bar exams! Found out today. His parents are throwing him a party on August 25th. I should get him something to mark it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 25th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him something to mark it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t089-016", "text": "Caught up with Jada over coffee. Her mum has been unwell since the summer and they finally have a diagnosis appointment on November 4th. Jada is driving up to Glasgow the Sunday before to be with her. Meanwhile her eldest, Imogen, is sitting her GCSE mocks that same week, so Jada is being pulled in every direction and sounds exhausted. I should message her on the 4th, and maybe drop a lasagne round once she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "unwell", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "diagnosis appointment", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE mocks", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that same week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop a lasagne round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t089-017", "text": "Jack and Teresa are expecting their second baby in March. Teresa has had awful morning sickness, so they haven't told many people yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t089-018", "text": "Bogdan Wright from work said his daughter got into Edinburgh to study architecture. He's over the moon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan Wright", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "study architecture", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-019", "text": "Sofia is the narrator in the school play on Thursday. Her dad Abebe says she's been practising her lines in the bath every night. Wish her luck on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-020", "text": "Yusuf is moving to Bristol in a fortnight for the new job. His girlfriend is staying in London until her lease ends in January, and then they'll look for somewhere together. He seems excited but a bit daunted by the long-distance part.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in London", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until her lease ends in January"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit daunted by the long-distance part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-021", "text": "Note to self: renew passport before the trip. Get the photos done this weekend, then fill in the online form.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew passport", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get the photos done", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "fill in the online form", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t089-022", "text": "Alice told me her sister Kerry has finally finished her PhD. The viva went well and graduation is in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viva", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t089-023", "text": "Varun's son is in the under-11 cup final on Saturday. Remind me to ask Varun on Sunday how the final went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "under-11 cup final", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Varun", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-024", "text": "Gemma's grandmother passed away last week. The funeral is on Friday at 11 at St Mary's. I'm going with Rhys.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t089-025", "text": "Thabo loves fly fishing and has been dropping hints about a new reel for his birthday in May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new reel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-026", "text": "Dorota's daughter graduates on May 14. She's the first in the family to go to university, so it's a big deal for all of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "first in the family to go to university", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t089-027", "text": "Groceries tonight, gym at 7 tomorrow, then the dentist at 2. Busy one.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 tomorrow", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the dentist", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2", "anchor": "a3"}]}
