{"id": "t089-032", "text": "Elif's daughter starts secondary school on September 4th. New uniform, new bus route, the lot. Elif is the nervous one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-033", "text": "Tendai update: his grandad is out of hospital and recovering at home, so the party is back on for August 16th. Tendai asked if I'd say a few words. I'm also bringing the cake. Need to call the bakery tomorrow to order it, and pick it up on the 15th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "recovering", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 16th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call the bakery", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick it up", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "a2"}]}
