{"id": "t089-055", "text": "Remind me to ring Eva on Friday. Darius gets his results that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Eva", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-056", "text": "Jada said her mum's appointment went better than expected. It's not cancer, just a cyst. Huge relief all round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cyst", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-057", "text": "Bumped into Akira and Rhys at the school gates. Their youngest starts reception in two weeks and their eldest is applying for sixth form. Rhys is counting down to his last day on the 30th and has already bought a canoe for retirement. They've invited me round for dinner a week on Saturday. I'm taking dessert.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for sixth form", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bought a canoe for retirement", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week on Saturday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t089-058", "text": "Abebe's wife sits her citizenship test on 3/27. She's been revising for months and is really anxious about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/27", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-059", "text": "Teresa mentioned her brother Bogdan has split up with his fiancée and moved back in with their parents. The wedding is off, obviously. He's taking it badly. I should message him this week, and maybe invite him to the pub quiz on Thursday to get him out of the house.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back in", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it badly", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him to the pub quiz", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t089-060", "text": "Parents' evening was fine, nothing to note. Just need to buy a new lunchbox and name labels before Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Parents' evening", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a new lunchbox and name labels", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
